      "body": "A 24-year-old creative with a background in fine arts and a keen interest in audio-visual storytelling, music, and the many ways people experience media. An avid gamer, comic and manga reader, and film enthusiast, I enjoy exploring stories across different formats and mediums. There's always more to watch, read, listen to, learn, and create than time allows, but I'm constantly looking for ways to expand my creative horizons and turn that curiosity into meaningful work."
